/**
 * \class graph_template
 * \brief Defines the schema for building graph-based data structures from event data.
 *
 * This class describes how event-level objects should be transformed into graphs (nodes, edges, global features).
 * In C++, this template acts as a factory that receives an `event_template` and outputs a compiled `graph_template`.
 *
 * \property graph_template::Tree
 * \brief The name of the original ROOT tree.
 *
 * \property graph_template::index
 * \brief The unique sequential index associated with this graph in the dataset.
 *
 * \property graph_template::PreSelection
 * \brief A boolean value indicating whether the graph passes initial topological filtering cuts.
 */
